config RT_USING_BL616_NETHUB
    bool "LEAKCAM: BL616 NetHub Wi-Fi over SDIO"
    depends on RT_USING_WIFI && RT_USING_SDIO
    select BSP_USING_WIFI_SDIO
    default n
    help
        Station Wi-Fi through a BL616 running Bouffalo's NetHub bridge on the
        SDIO host of BSP_WIFI_SDIO_HOST (SDIO id 424c:0606). The BL616 bridges
        Ethernet frames; lwIP on this side runs DHCP and all sockets.
